{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhouyu-e-p008a","title":"黄盖诈降书及曹操见使疑诈许赏","accounts":[{"id":"zhouyu-e-p008a-account","label":"《江表传》","text":"黄盖诈降书及曹操见使疑诈许赏","evidence":["zhouyu-e-p008a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"huang-gai","role":"致诈降书","evidence":["zhouyu-e-p008a-q"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"问使","evidence":["zhouyu-e-p008a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":208,"label":"火攻前","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"zhouyu-y208","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"zhouyu-q-o009","basis":"火攻前"},"evidence":["zhouyu-e-p008a-q","zhouyu-q-o009","zhouyu-q-b-63f47c62fde80b3a0132"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhouyu-e-p008a-q","source_order":[54,86,"P008a"],"order":9602}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"huang-gai","name":"黄盖","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhouyu-e-p008a-q","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-3830f394958f2c817046","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《江表传》载：“盖书曰：‘盖受孙氏厚恩，常为将帅，见遇不薄。然顾天下事有大势：用江东六郡山越之人，以当中国百万之众；众寡不敌，海内所共见也。东方将吏，无有愚智，皆知其不可；惟周瑜、鲁肃偏怀浅戆，意未解耳。今日归命，是其实计。瑜所督领，自易摧破。交锋之日，盖为前部；当因事变化，效命在近。’曹公特见行人，密问之，口敕曰：‘但恐汝诈耳。盖若信实，当授爵赏，超于前后也。’”","attribution":"《江表传》","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-db3d427be3ca93ad61d8","start":0,"end":187,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-q-b-63f47c62fde80b3a0132","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-63f47c62fde80b3a0132","layer":"modern","quote":"〖6〗十三年：建安十三年（公元 208）。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":43,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8f109f42647e5ee8d831","start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-q-o009","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-3661896c106f1817bf4b","layer":"original","quote":"十三年春〖6〗，权讨江夏，瑜为前部大督〖7〗。其年九月，曹公入荆州，刘琮举众降。曹公得其水军船，步兵数十万。将士闻之皆恐。（惧）〔权〕延见群下〖8〗，问以计策。议者咸曰：“曹公，豺虎也！然托名汉相，挟天子以征四方，动以朝廷为辞；今日拒之，事更不顺。且将军大势：可以拒操者，长江也。今操得荆州，奄有其地〖9〗；刘表治水军，蒙冲、斗舰〖10〗，乃以千数，操悉浮以沿江；兼有步兵，水陆俱下。此为长江之险，已与我共之矣。而势力众寡，又不可论。愚谓大计不如迎之。”","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":34,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":227,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
